        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by an `ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException` due to the addition of a new "Responsibility" column in the table layout without updating the corresponding array of column alignment strings to match the new number of columns. This mismatch occurred when an instructor was assigned to classes but there was no committed timetable, leading to an attempt to access an index in the array that did not exist.

        Commit message:
        Instructor Detail: Class Assignments

- fixed an ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException thrown when the instructor is assigned to one or more classes, but there is no committed timetable yet
- the problem has been introduced by a recent change (commit cef4170, added Responsibility column)
- this fixes issue #27  

